<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE - Preliminary Dec W.German CPI.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE - Preliminary Dec W.German CPI.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following German economic indicators are expected to be released next week:</p>
<p>    INDICATOR	PERIOD	 PREVIOUS		 EXPECTED</p>
<p>					    DATA		     DATE</p>
<p> CPI inflation    Dec/year    Nov 1.4 pct y/y	   Dec 23</p>
